#: src/Admin/HelpView.php:25
msgid "Culprit Finder switches plugins off for your browser only and asks after each change whether the problem is still there. It narrows the list down by halves, so 30 plugins take about 7 answers. It also catches two plugins that only fail together."
msgstr ""

